{"id":"n17301-2-20","stage":0,"title":"전 · 前","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17301-2-20-1","ko":"미안해. 좀 늦었네.","zh":"对不起，我来晚啦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미안해.","meaning":"抱歉，对不起，不好意思","explanation":"미안하다：抱歉，对不起，不好意思；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"미안하다","audio":"/audio/a3bb8e6d52d6985107bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67883","senseId":"2","lemma":"미안하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늦었네.","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a3bb8e6d52d69851","term":"미안하다","zh":"抱歉，对不起，不好意思","audio":"/audio/a3bb8e6d52d6985107bb.mp3","entryId":"67883","definition":"谦虚地向对方请求谅解。","pronunciation":["미안하다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]}],"audio":"/audio/644521c0f1710b8b948a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17301-2-20-2","ko":"아니. 나도 조금 전에 왔어.","zh":"没事，我也是刚到不久。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니.","meaning":"不是，不用，不要","explanation":"아니：不是，不用，不要","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65982","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"